              Peter Selinger,
              = succeed ";" do
                %a{:href => "http://permalink.gmane.org/gmane.science.mathematics.categories/5805"}
                  %code categories
                  post of 2010-05-15
            %li
              Peter Selinger,
              %em
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0908.3347"} A survey of graphical languages for monoidal categories
